#
# restate-proxy's own options, besides --serve (restate-proxy(8)): where it
# listens, its certificate and key, its grants, its limits. Its defaults are
# :8443, /etc/restate/proxy.crt and proxy.key, and /etc/restate/proxy.d.
#RESTATE_PROXY_OPTS="--listen :8443"
RESTATE_PROXY_OPTS=""
